     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Tuesday, May 3, 2016 at 8:18:41 AM UTC-7, Erik Westlund wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">ui.R and server.R should be located in the root directory (/Shinyapp) <div><br></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>"
