   "date": "2016-05-03T15:32:10Z",
   "subject": "Re: Local Shiny app -- subdirectory issue",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Not sure that&#39;s possible.  <div><br></div><div>You&#39;d want to create something like </div><div><br></div><div>/shinyapp2</div><div><br></div><div>in the same directory as your original app, not in the original apps directory</div><div><br></div><div>If you need to share assets I&#39;d specify with absolute and not relative paths.</div><div><br></div><div>If you need to host multiple apps on same server at different domains or subdomains you&#39;ll need to proxy to those apps using apache or nginx.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Erik</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
